{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:31:37+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Style - Pixel Art Jigsaw Puzzles", "steam_appid": 2319080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2322160], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jigsaw puzzles made for pixel art</h2>Retro Style cuts every puzzle along the picture's own pixel grid. Knobs, edges and bevels are drawn in pixels too, so every piece stays crisp at any zoom, from a cosy 24 pieces to a 594-piece marathon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pictures that come alive</h2>Place the last piece and the picture powers on: lanterns glow, rain falls on neon streets, waterfalls flow, snow drifts and stars twinkle. Every finished picture waits for you in the Gallery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax, or race the clock</h2><strong>Relaxed mode</strong> gives you the whole toolbox: show only edge pieces, sort by colour, peek at the box lid, show a ghost image, ask for a hint or turn on piece rotation. Your puzzle saves itself, so you can stop any time.<br><br><strong>Arcade mode</strong> is a 45-piece race. Connect pieces quickly to chain combos up to x8, finish fast for a time bonus, earn a rank from D to S and compare scores on the Steam leaderboards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 detailed pixel art scenes, from a lighthouse harbour to a neon arcade, a dragon's hoard and a haunted manor<br></li><li>8 puzzle sizes: 24, 45, 96, 153, 220, 299, 432 and 594 pieces<br></li><li>Living pictures with animated light, water, weather and particles<br></li><li>Relaxed and Arcade modes, Steam leaderboards and 24 achievements<br></li><li>Chiptune soundtrack and retro sound effects<br></li><li>Four table themes and an optional CRT filter<br></li><li>Play with mouse, keyboard or controller</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansion Pack 1</h2>16 more pictures: a medieval market, a snowy train station, a synthwave city, a viking fjord under the northern lights, a night carnival,